OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper chosen to revamp        
OL,4,Ahistoric harbour sites                 
OL,6,FThe property firm behind an apartment  
OL,7,Fcomplex on St Helier's Waterfront has  
OL,8,Fbeen appointed as an investment partner
OL,9,Fin a scheme to regenerate more historic
OL,10,Fbuildings in the harbour.              
OL,12,FPorts of Jersey said it had appointed  
OL,13,FLegendre to transform Merchants' Quay  
OL,14,Fand La Folie. It said the firm's       
OL,15,Fundisclosed investment would protect an
OL,16,Fimportant part of the island's         
OL,17,Fheritage.                              
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
