OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper chosen to revamp        
OL,4,Ahistoric harbour sites                 
OL,6,FAlan Maclean, minister for treasury and
OL,7,Fresources, said Legendre's funding     
OL,8,Fmeant the scheme, to include a hotel,  
OL,9,Fwould not place "demands on public     
OL,10,Ffinances".                             
OL,12,FLuc Richard, director of the Jersey    
OL,13,FBranch of Legendre, the company behind 
OL,14,Fthe Horizon development, said his team 
OL,15,Fwas "passionate" about restoring       
OL,16,Fhistoric buildings.                    
